{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":149816,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nChristineandWilliam has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"your wedding\".\n\nChristineandWilliam said:\n======================================================================\nThank you for getting back to me. Did you happen to have kids within your family attend? I am shocked at the cost of a child going vs an adult. It s about a $50 difference and children do not drink. Also if I waited till June, are we looking at more chances of rain?. Yes the Majestic Elegance is all all inclusive.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=13828&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":287260,"Name":"ChristineandWilliam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1467703361,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13828},{"Id":149635,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nChristineandWilliam has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"your wedding\".\n\nChristineandWilliam said:\n======================================================================\nHello I read your post about your wedding in PC, we want to get married at the Majestic , can you please help me..lol...We are looking to get married in April of 2018 but trying to figure out the cost is overwhelming...we are only having 20 to 30 tops so I don't want a private party, was hoping to do something at the Sea and See restaurant ( one of the on site restaurants) where it would all be including. It it really just my family with each one of our close friends. It looks like it is going to be close to $2100 a per adult for the 7 days for hotel and flight, and $1750 per child ( we will have 4 kids within the family. Any thoughts or advice.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=13828#msg23951\n","Sender":{"Id":287260,"Name":"ChristineandWilliam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1467202422,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13828},{"Id":148557,"Title":"liked a post you made in Are There Any Resorts That...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nif you want send me your email address and I  can send them to you via email..\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80069-are-there-any-resorts-that-have-private-ceremonies-non-beach\/?view=findpost&p=1913899\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1465031658,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":147885,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\n2017weddingguy has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"pics\".\n\n2017weddingguy said:\n======================================================================\n06dixon@gmail.com thanks so much\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=13568#msg23567\n","Sender":{"Id":286853,"Name":"2017weddingguy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1463744670,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13568},{"Id":147622,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that 2017weddingguy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80069-are-there-any-resorts-that-have-private-ceremonies-non-beach\/?view=findpost&p=1913812\n\n----------------------------------\nYes! Please share the pictures!\n@\"lorishultz2016\"\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":286853,"Name":"2017weddingguy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1463508221,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":147440,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nRandL2015 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Chair ties\".\n\nRandL2015 said:\n======================================================================\nI have plenty of the green probably all 30. Right now, I only see about 4 or 5 of the purple. I started out with 50 of each. Don't know if they were thrown away.\nThe fabric is a sheer organza. Trying to post pictures.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=13527&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1463347729,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13527},{"Id":147416,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nRandL2015 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Chair ties\".\n\nRandL2015 said:\n======================================================================\nDo you still need them? I have some green and purple. How many do you need?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=13527#msg23487\n","Sender":{"Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1463312452,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13527},{"Id":146663,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that acw271011 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80072-looking-for-iteams-to-buy\/?view=findpost&p=1913280\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"lorishultz2016\" There are a number of sites on the internet that sell them at a pretty reasonable price. I've seen them as low as about 40 cents each in organza. If you want satin I think they cost a little more, but not a ton. If you're only looking for about 20 of each, 60 in total, I'm sure you could get them all for about $40, especially being in the US. The brides in canada are the ones that get killed on the shipping, even more so if it's a US site and they ship internationally.\n \nhttp:\/\/www.chaircoverfactory.com\/Chair-Sashes-s\/254.htm\n \nhttp:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/chairsashes.html\n \nhttp:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com\/?&gclid=Cj0KEQjwmKG5BRDv4YaE5t6oqf0BEiQAwqDNfJ3oBW6my9uI7uovkmwNEfg6nScy_mnj0Pz1a6dHMMQaAtIr8P8HAQ\n \nhttp:\/\/www.linentablecloth.com\/chair-covers-and-sashes\/chair-sashes.html\n \nhttp:\/\/www.efavormart.com\/wedding-chair-sashes.aspx\n \n \nI got mine at efavormart and they were just great so I would recommend them, but I'm sure if any of the other ladies have had an experience with any of the other suppliers they'll chime in with a review.\n \nGood luck!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1462278156,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"8","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
