{"Success":true,"Data":{"OtherParticipants":[],"Messages":[{"Id":23951,"Author":{"Id":287260,"Name":"ChristineandWilliam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1467202423,"Content":"Hello I read your post about your wedding in PC, we want to get married at the Majestic , can you please help me..lol...We are looking to get married in April of 2018 but trying to figure out the cost is overwhelming...we are only having 20 to 30 tops so I don't want a private party, was hoping to do something at the Sea and See restaurant ( one of the on site restaurants) where it would all be including. It it really just my family with each one of our close friends. It looks like it is going to be close to $2100 a per adult for the 7 days for hotel and flight, and $1750 per child ( we will have 4 kids within the family. Any thoughts or advice.","PostKey":"052936b24bfd993acab1089c01fb6f86","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":23982,"Author":{"Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1467533322,"Content":"<p>my first thing I would tell you is if you have not already done this. Talk to a travel agent they sometimes can get you deals that don't show up on the\u00a0web site. And I worked with someone at wright travel they are know for the\u00a0dentations wedding folks and they know there stuff. I know the lady I worked with gave us a good deal and I chose the hotel that we are having our wedding at all on\u00a0her advice and we are very\u00a0pleased with the hotel. Also look at the time of year and make\u00a0sure it is not peak season. I believe April is due to spring break is still going on at that time. And the best thing is make sure your hotel is all inclusive you get really good deals there and more for your money. And I would try to get all the hotel stuff booked way in advance so your family can pay for it a little at a time that is always a goo help.\u00a0I am sorry this has taken me so long to get this info to you. If you need more help please message me anytime. Lori\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"8ee66bf53f34759225dac623fa23d30e","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":23995,"Author":{"Id":287260,"Name":"ChristineandWilliam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1467703361,"Content":"<p>Thank you for getting back to me. Did you happen to have kids within your family attend? I am shocked at the cost of a child going vs an adult. It s about a $50 difference and children do not drink. Also if I waited till June, are we looking at more chances of rain?. Yes the Majestic Elegance is all all inclusive.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"3b225c24195446311e84b1084faa511e","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Id":13828,"Subject":"your wedding","StartDate":1467202422,"Starter":{"Id":287260,"Name":"ChristineandWilliam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"To":{"Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Preview":{"Id":23995,"Author":{"Id":287260,"Name":"ChristineandWilliam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1467703361,"Content":"Thank you for getting back to me. Did you happen to have kids within your family attend? I am sho...","PostKey":"3b225c24195446311e84b1084faa511e","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},"IsRead":true,"IsDeleted":false,"TotalReplies":2,"Notifications":true,"CanReply":true},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
