211; Josh Turner<br \/> Wouldn&#8217;t it be Nice &#8211; Beach Boys<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Reception:<\/strong><br \/> Baby got Back &#8211; Sir Mix A Lot<br \/> Brown Eyed Girl &#8211; Van Morrison<br \/> Blister In the Sun &#8211; Violent Femmes<br \/> Celebration &#8211; Kool & the Gang<br \/> Cha Cha Slide &#8211; Casper C<br \/> Come on Eileen &#8211; Dexy&#8217;s Midnight Runners<br \/> Come What May &#8211; Moulin Rouge Soundtrack<br \/> Dancing in the Dark &#8211; Bruce Springsteen<br \/> Footloose &#8211; Kenny Loggins <br \/> Dancing Queen &#8211; Abba<br \/> Do you Wanna Dance &#8211; Beach Boys<br \/> Every Breath you Take &#8211; UB40<br \/> Get the Party Started &#8211; Pink<br \/> Girls Just Want to Have Fun &#8211; Cyndi Lauper<br \/> Glamorous &#8211; Fergie<br \/> Hey Ya - Outkast<br \/> Hot, Hot, Hot &#8211; Buster Poindexter<br \/> I Love Rock N&#8217; Roll &#8211; Britney Spears<br \/> Let&#8217;s Hear it for the Boy &#8211; Deniece Williams<br \/> Life is a Highway &#8211; Rascal Flatts<br \/> Margaritaville &#8211; Jimmy Buffet<br \/> Mony, Mony &#8211; Billy Idol<br \/> Pon De Replay &#8211; Rihanna<br \/> Pour Some Sugar on Me &#8211; Def Leopard<br \/> Shout &#8211; Otis Day<br \/> SOS &#8211; Rihanna<br \/> Sugar Pie Honey Bunch (I Can&#8217;t Help Myself)<br \/> Summer of 69 &#8211; Bryan Adams<br \/> Sweet Caroline &#8211; Neil Diamond<br \/> The Way we Are &#8211; Timbaland<br \/> What I like About You &#8211; Romantics<br \/> Yeah - Usher<br \/> YMCA &#8211; Village People<br \/> I&#8217;ve Had the Time of My Life &#8211; Dirty Dancing Soundtrack<br \/> Last Dance &#8211; Donna Summers<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Slow Songs:<\/strong><br \/> You Are &#8211; Jimmy Wayne &#8211; First Dance<br \/> Can&#8217;t Help Falling in Love &#8211; Elvis<br \/> Lost in this Moment &#8211; Big & Rich<br \/> Love of a Lifetime &#8211; Firehouse<br \/> I&#8217;ll Stand by You &#8211; Carrie Underwood<br \/> I Got You &#8211; James Brown<br \/> I&#8217;ll 