ked":false,"PostKey":"d9c01049a5f5fdcbdcd25ef0c6da96dd","RawContent":"I&#039;m so glad I found this thread. I left the music list for the DJ up to my Fiance as he is really into music.. However, he just started working on the list this Week and we have 3 weeks to go!!! YIKES. Looks like i need to start adding some songs! I will definelty send him this link so he can get some ideas. Thanks Ladies","Attachments":[],"Id":691775,"PostDate":1242338082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm so glad I found this thread. I left the music list for the DJ up to my Fiance as he is really into music.. However, he just started working on the list this Week and we have 3 weeks to go!!! YIKES. Looks like i need to start adding some songs! I will definelty send him this link so he can get some ideas. Thanks Ladies\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"DeBooCL@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231617311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213816.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":50,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DeBooCL","Id":213816,"Name":"DeBooCL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"133a5717c9b1210c22bed665c93e505c","RawContent":"Ladies coming up... when you make up your list be sure to post it! We could use some more ideas!","Attachments":[],"Id":691815,"PostDate":1242340319,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ladies coming up... when you make up your list be sure to post it! We could use some more ideas!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212456600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ae680e41bf82ce711eaeeea9267465b","RawContent":"aaaaaahhh i&#039;m working on mine now and it&#039;s SO hard. when it comes down to it, if my whole reception is 3 hours, then like an hour of that will be dinner. how the heck do i narrow it down to just 2 hours of dance-type music? not to mention slip in a couple of slow songs and stuff to satisfy the old-folk?!?! SO HARD!\n \n oh, and i hate the freakin&#039; electric slide but i know people will expect it! *sigh*","Attachments":[],"Id":691960,"PostDate":1242347447,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                aaaaaahhh i'm working on mine now and it's SO hard. when it comes down to it, if my whole reception is 3 hours, then like an hour of that will be dinner. how the heck do i narrow it down to just 2 hours of dance-type music? not to mention slip in a couple of slow songs and stuff to satisfy the old-folk?!?! SO HARD!<br \/> <br \/> oh, and i hate the freakin' electric slide but i know people will expect it! *sigh*\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207088760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12f9bb34ca12f94ebe4b3f8cf8155df5","RawContent":"I started working on mine and it is SO hard!!!!!!! I want to make sure we have more than enough music. I don&#039;t want to come down to repeating a song or searching for something else! But I have our ceremony, 1 - 1 1\/2 hours of cocktails, dinner for 1-2 hours and then depending on how long dinner is we have 3-4 hours of dancing!!!!! I need ALOT of songs!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":692221,"PostDate":1242360075,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I started working on mine and it is SO hard!!!!!!! I want to make sure we have more than enough music. I don't want to come down to repeating a song or searching for something else! But I have our ceremony, 1 - 1 1\/2 hours of cocktails, dinner for 1-2 hours and then depending on how long dinner is we have 3-4 hours of dancing!!!!! I need ALOT of songs!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212456600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed283a0e0c61a5636c421eba504a6205","RawContent":"I am so glad I just saw this!! Thanks for all the great playlists! My DJ has been asking me what I want him to play at my AHR.","Attachments":[],"Id":692226,"PostDate":1242360444,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am so glad I just saw this!! Thanks for all the great playlists! My DJ has been asking me what I want him to play at my AHR.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"desireemeg84@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1216309680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210607.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":73,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tylersgirl","Id":210607,"Name":"tylersgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fc329b6c74c74f7beafc43c4fcf8228","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jacilynda&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I started working on mine and it is SO hard!!!!!!! I want to make sure we have more than enough music. I don&#039;t want to come down to repeating a song or searching for something else! But I have our ceremony, 1 - 1 1\/2 hours of cocktails, dinner for 1-2 hours and then depending on how long dinner is we have 3-4 hours of dancing!!!!! I need ALOT of songs!!!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;i wish i needed that much music ... my whole problem is that other than the few songs for the ceremony, all i need is about 1 hours of dinner music and 2 hours of dancing music! (we have a mariachi trio for cocktail hour)\n \n when i first starting gathering up the songs i wanted, i had about FIVE HOURS of music for dinner, LOL. it&#039;s impossible to narrow it down to under 20 songs! stupid FI actually wants a say in what gets played too LOL, so that makes it even harder! i just think it&#039;s much easier to come up with 100 songs you love than it is to come up with the perfect 15-20, ya know?","Attachments":[],"Id":692647,"PostDate":1242399802,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jacilynda<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I started working on mine and it is SO hard!!!!!!! I want to make sure we have more than enough music. I don't want to come down to repeating a song or searching for something else! But I have our ceremony, 1 - 1 1\/2 hours of cocktails, dinner for 1-2 hours and then depending on how long dinner is we have 3-4 hours of dancing!!!!! I need ALOT of songs!!!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>i wish i needed that much music ... my whole problem is that other than the few songs for the ceremony, all i need is about 1 hours of dinner music and 2 hours of dancing music! (we have a mariachi trio for cocktail hour)<br \/> <br \/> when i first starting gathering up the songs i wanted, i had about FIVE HOURS of music for dinner, LOL. it's impossible to narrow it down to under 20 songs! stupid FI actually wants a say in what gets played too LOL, so that makes it even harder! i just think it's much easier to come up with 100 songs you love than it is to come up with the perfect 15-20, ya know?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207088760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af25cdb26114b581e852cc598d2e892f","RawContent":"I agree with many of the others. Thanks for starting this thread cause I need to get my list together.","Attachments":[],"Id":692678,"PostDate":1242401321,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree with many of the others. Thanks for starting this thread cause I need to get my list together.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janicebryce@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1241456588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217272.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanJan84","Id":217272,"Name":"JanJan84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e62913330d701d7c7442b948c1564551","RawContent":"You should pick 100 songs and just put it on shuffle! HA! See what happens! You guys will be hammered you won&#039;t care whats playing!","Attachments":[],"Id":692679,"PostDate":1242401341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You should pick 100 songs and just put it on shuffle! HA! See what happens! You guys will be hammered you won't care whats playing!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Plann