Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1426,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1888654,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1425718958,"LastPoster":{"Id":245258,"Name":"YS Studios","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245258.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":45,"Preview":{"Id":1914645,"PostDate":1467641526,"PostContent":"Laura ~ I am so sorry you are experience this type of behavior with so called Wedding Professiona...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melisakeltner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315911984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245258.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YS Studios","Id":245258,"Name":"YS Studios","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.137.245.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78883,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4da6451cb21f9ac3d39aab7394cbb4ee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;it is the same on travel sites like Trip Advisor - everyone bashes the food and then a 5 star rating on it and everything was wonderful all within the same time frame.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You really have to look into people who have no picture, are new or have questionable credablility - but who am I to say - I just joined today lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913508,"PostDate":1462884050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>it is the same on travel sites like Trip Advisor - everyone bashes the food and then a 5 star rating on it and everything was wonderful all within the same time frame.<\/p>\n<p>You really have to look into people who have no picture, are new or have questionable credablility - but who am I to say - I just joined today lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462864536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AdamnJenn17","Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78883,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77f986b119f7db18d30786b48552c97b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Laura ~ I am so sorry you are experience this type of behavior with so called Wedding Professionals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Things to look for when booking someone to come with you for your DW are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are they a legitimate business first of all?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Do they have a web page and real reviews?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are they paying taxes and have a business license?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Do they have past clients that you can chat with?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are they showing you an entire gallery of edited Wedding Images?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ask all of these questions and ask to see proof. It&#039;s your Wedding Day and you deserve the world!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My husband and I see many people get excited to travel &amp;amp; shoot Weddings then come on to make fake forums and over post to get interest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They have not only sub par work but their ethics and morals are in the gutter as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You should raise the bar and call them out ladies!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Keep doing that so others know ~&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914645,"PostDate":1467641526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Laura ~ I am so sorry you are experience this type of behavior with so called Wedding Professionals.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Things to look for when booking someone to come with you for your DW are:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are they a legitimate business first of all?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Do they have a web page and real reviews?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are they paying taxes and have a business license?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Do they have past clients that you can chat with?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are they showing you an entire gallery of edited Wedding Images?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ask all of these questions and ask to see proof. It's your Wedding Day and you deserve the world!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My husband and I see many people get excited to travel & shoot Weddings then come on to make fake forums and over post to get interest.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They have not only sub par work but their ethics and morals are in the gutter as well.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You should raise the bar and call them out ladies!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Keep doing that so others know ~\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melisakeltner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315911984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245258.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YS Studios","Id":245258,"Name":"YS Studios","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78883","Title":"Questionable Reviews","LastPostDate":1467641526},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
